// Readable form of MAPHEAD.SCN, made by `dws decompile --readable`. Every event below was compiled and proven equivalent to the
// original section (control-flow bisimulation, tools/dws/flowcmp.py); sections that cannot be an event stay in the port form.
// Text is by key (text/us/dialogue.json), never the game's own words.
import "../../core/engine.dws";
import "../names.dws";
maphead {
    section(220) replace {    // section 220
        set_script(180, 220);
        engine.music_mode = 1;
        set_bgm(23);
        if (factory_shut_down && !is_recruited(species("Numemon"))) {
            load_digimon(species(135));
            set_digimon(species(135), 1, 0);
            return;
        }
        if (!is_recruited(species("Numemon"))) {
            load_digimon(species(135));
            set_digimon(species(135), 0, 0);
        }
        if (island_history_read && !key_chain_found.sewer) {
            load_digimon(species(171));
            set_digimon(species(171), 2, 0);
        }
    }
}
